    "body": "I was very confused when I realized that this library was loading VueAnalytics on the project I am developing, with someone else's UA agent. I consider this a major privacy violation, and I couldn't find any documentation or configuration option to disable it. As someone working on projects that are privacy sensitive and GDPR compliant, I need to fork Buefy and disable that feature completely. \r\n\r\nI appreciate all the work that goes into building and maintaining a top-notch open source package like Buefy and it has saved me a lot of time, but this information needs to be disclosed and _opt-in only_. I'm sure a lot of people are using this library and don't realize how their information is being used. ",
